ANNOUNCING RED HAT MOTIF 2.0
============================

Linux is the most popular OS for the PC for doing serious
client/server software development.  Red Hat Motif will turn your
Linux PC into a Motif development workstation.  It is built and
supported by one of the leading Linux distribution vendors.

USE RED HAT MOTIF TO:
=====================

*   Develop applications for your commercial UNIX using customers or employer. 

*   Learn Motif programming for personal/career advancement.

*   Control and run Motif based programs on your Linux system.

*   Use the 'mwm' window manager.

This is the full 0SF/Motif 2.0 development system.

