	* fault tolerant software
	* graphics software
	* an event action specification tool
	* software development environment tools

Global Technologies Ltd., Inc. provides our customers with 
a 30 day refund period, and of course, technical support.
We hope to be of service to you in the future.

To order our products, please call 908-251-2840.

We accept VISA / MASTERCARD / AMEX , money orders
and personal checks.  Payment required prior to shipping.

	Thank-you,

	Charles Northrup

PS.  Please allow 2-4 weeks for shipping.


