                     adduser-1.0 Security Vulnerability
                          LINUX SECURITY FAQ UPDATE
                        October 17, 1995 15:30:01 EST
      Copyright (C) 1995 Alexander O. Yuriev (alex@bach.cis.temple.edu)
                              CIS Laboratories
                             TEMPLE  UNIVERSITY
