mime-version: 1.0
newsgroups: comp.os.linux.announce

-----BEGIN PGP SIGNED MESSAGE-----


10 Out Of 1 Desk is a complete X11-based office software for Linux, which 
puts an end to the lack of this kind of software in the Linux 
environment. It includes:

- - the 10 Out Of 1 GUI library, which has a look and feel similar to Motif(R),
  Windows 95(TM), Worplace Shell(TM) etc.

- - the 10 Out Of 1 Window Manager

- - the 10 Out Of 1 desktop, comparable to the Macintosh(R) Finder(TM) or the
  Windows 95(TM) Explorer(TM)

- - Littera, a powerful word processor

- - Anaconda, a spreadsheet application with 2D and 3D graphics

- - Sophia, a powerful database application

- - many desktop utilities, e.g. calculator, calendar etc.

- - tools needed to develop your own 10 Out Of 1 compliant software

- - of course you can integrate other X11-applications in the desktop without
  effort

The 10 Out Of 1 Office software has features such as cut & paste, drag & 
drop, inter application communication, online help, networking 
capabilities etc. It sells for $699.00, $299.00 for students as well as 
educational and research organisations. Please add $5.00 for shipping.
German users can obtain the 10 Out Of 1 Office for DM 899.00, DM 399.00 
for edu-orgs and students.
15% of the price will be donated to Amnesty International.

A full "Plug & Play" Linux distribution, the 10 Out Of 1 Linux CD, that 
comes with the 10 Out Of 1 Desktop is planned for the near future. 
Customers of the Office software will receive an update to the 10 Out Of 
1 CD for under $100.00.

The software will be available by Nov 15th (probably earlier ;-) from:

Moonlite Information Services
Steinmatten 2
79194 Gundelfinden
Germany

Call +49 171 3675843 for more information.



