Option list:
Useage: die [-cfhil|-CFHIL] [process(es)]
Kill off processes by command name, rather than PID number:
- -c Careful mode.  Prompt for kill on all processes.
- -f forces die to kill off all listed processes, without asking questions.
- -i Interactive mode.  Interactively kill processes.
- -l List mode.  Gives a listing of all current processes
- -h Help mode.  Gives more detailed help and info. (pipe through more)
(default mode is to confirm each kill only in the event of duplicate processes)
